    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an orange\u2014just an ordinary piece of fruit with an extraordinary dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world below is chaos: slippery surfaces, towering obstacles, and endless opportunities to fall. But somewhere above, beyond the madness, lies something greater\u2014a place where you truly belong. The fruit bowl. A symbol of purpose, of unity, of something more than just rolling around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one said it would be easy. The climb is unforgiving. There are no shortcuts. No checkpoints. Only determination, gravity, and you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But maybe, just maybe... this is your moment. A time to rise. To prove that even a small orange can defy the odds. To discover what you\u2019re really made of\u2014pulp and persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a journey of patience. Of failure. Of getting back up no matter how many times you fall. Are you ready to bounce?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an orange\u2014just an ordinary piece of fruit with an extraordinary dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world below is chaos: slippery surfaces, towering obstacles, and endless opportunities to fall. But somewhere above, beyond the madness, lies something greater\u2014a place where you truly belong. The fruit bowl. A symbol of purpose, of unity, of something more than just rolling around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one said it would be easy. The climb is unforgiving. There are no shortcuts. No checkpoints. Only determination, gravity, and you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But maybe, just maybe... this is your moment. A time to rise. To prove that even a small orange can defy the odds. To discover what you\u2019re really made of\u2014pulp and persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a journey of patience. Of failure. Of getting back up no matter how many times you fall. Are you ready to bounce?</p>",
    "short_description": "An exciting platformer where you play as an orange navigating a series of challenging obstacles to reach the top. Jump and roll your way through a dynamic environment, all in pursuit of the ultimate prize\u2014the fruit bowl at the peak.",
